==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*10 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mysterious Calamity]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 133.33~146.67 seconds<sup>4,000f~4,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since both Zang Roo and Cyberhorn spawn after 100 seconds, it's best to rush down Mysterious Calamity as fast as you can. Some good units for this role are high level [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] (level 40 is recommended but not necessary).

